# Data fetching (apps/host)

## Server (RSC, server actions, Route Handlers)
- External/server data in RSC: native `fetch` with explicit cache (`cache`, `next.revalidate`)
- Mutations & form flows: `"use server"` actions in `apps/host/src/lib/actions/`
- Return `{ ok: true, data } | { ok: false, error }` — do not throw for expected failures
- Route Handlers live in `apps/host/src/app/api/`; use `apps/host/src/lib/mock-db.ts` for in-memory data

## Client (interactive UI, cache, polling)
- Use hooks in `apps/host/src/hooks/` with `@tanstack/react-query`
- HTTP calls go through `http` from `@/lib/http-client` → same-origin `/api/*`
- Do NOT add axios or fetch directly inside random components

## Avoid
- Fetching in Client Components when a Server Component or server action fits
- Bypassing `http-client.ts` for dashboard API calls
- Storing session tokens in `localStorage` (use HttpOnly cookie pattern via `lib/auth.ts`)
